The name tables in this directory (the .json files) hold text extracted from
Baldur's Gate: Enhanced Edition: its dialog.tlk, its UI Lua (BGEE.LUA), and
its IDS and 2DA files. The text is Beamdog's.

No license in this repository covers these files. The MIT License and the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later, which cover the rest of the
repository, do not apply to them.

kits/bg1/scripts/extract-tables.mjs builds them from a game install
(docs/architecture.md §6.6.3).
